# iCloud Drive writes conflict copies as "file 2.js", "file 3.js" when the same
# checkout syncs across machines. They are never real source. Keep them out of
# commits; `npm run clean:icloud-dups` removes them from the working tree.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*

